            <p>Abu Dhabi Islamic Bank (ADIB) has appointed Pedro Uria-Recio a=
s its new Chief AI Officer to advance its Vision 2035 strategy. Uria-Recio br=
ings over 20 years of experience, having previously led AI strategies at CIMB=
 Bank.</p>
            <p>In his new role, he will oversee the responsible deployment of=
 artificial intelligence across the bank. The initiative aims to enhance cust=
omer experiences, strengthen risk management, improve operational efficiency,=
 and equip employees with advanced analytical tools.</p>
            <p class=3D"trend-summary">So What? ADIB's appointment of a dedic=
ated Chief AI Officer underscores the strategic importance of AI in modern ba=
nking. Financial institutions must establish clear executive leadership to go=
vern AI integration, ensuring technological initiatives align with long-term =
business goals.</p>
