            <h3>Trend 2: CIFTIS 2026 to Showcase "AI Digital Empowerment" in =
Financial Services</h3>
            <p>The 2026 China International Fair for Trade in Services (CIFTI=
S) will feature a dedicated financial services section focused on "AI Digital=
 Empowerment." The event will bring together 75 major domestic and internatio=
nal financial institutions.</p>
            <p>Leading banks, including ICBC and Agricultural Bank of China, =
will showcase their latest proprietary AI models, such as "ICBC Zhice." Addit=
ionally, firms will present AI-driven climate risk models and specialized ins=
urance products for the robotics sector.</p>
            <p class=3D"trend-summary">So What? CIFTIS highlights how global =
financial institutions are transitioning AI from experimental projects to cor=
e operational assets. Banks must continuously monitor these international sho=
wcases to benchmark their own digital capabilities against global industry le=
aders.</p>
